        "original_id": "5beb1d70-977c-5a69-85fc-76a1b5e89ce8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chumlee, Corey Harrison, Rick Harrison, Richard Benjamin Harrison Jr.\n- Organizations: World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop, History channel\n- Shows: Pawn Stars\n- Places: Las Vegas\n\nFacts:\n- In 1989, Rick Harrison and his father, Richard Benjamin Harrison, opened the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop.\n- Chumlee was a childhood friend of Corey Harrison.\n- Chumlee began working at the pawn shop five years before filming of the first season of Pawn Stars.\n- Richard Benjamin Harrison Jr. was born on March 4, 1941.\n- Richard Benjamin Harrison Jr. was also known by the nicknames The Old Man and The Appraiser.\n- Richard Benjamin Harrison Jr. was a Las Vegas businessman and reality television personality.\n- Richard Benjamin Harrison Jr. was best known as the co-owner of the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop.\n- The History channel series Pawn Stars featured the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
